'''''Weigela hortensis''''' is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Caprifoliaceae]], native to [[Hokkaido]] and [[Honshu]] islands of Japan.<ref name="60463213-2" >{{cite POWO |id=60463213-2 |title=''Weigela hortensis'' (Siebold & Zucc.) K.Koch |access-date=28 July 2022 }}</ref> A rounded shrub reaching {{cvt|10|ft|0}}, and hardy in [[Hardiness zone|USDA zones]] 6 through 9, it is occasionally found in commerce.<ref name="MBG_255806" >{{cite web |url=https://www.missouribotanicalgarden.org/PlantFinder/PlantFinderDetails.aspx?taxonid=255806 |title=''Weigela hortensis'' |author=<!--Not stated--> |date=2022 |website=Plant Finder |publisher=Missouri Botanical Garden |access-date=28 July 2022 }}</ref><ref name="RHS_21464" >{{cite web |title=''Weigela hortensis'' |url=https://www.rhs.org.uk/plants/21464/weigela-hortensis/details |date=2022 |publisher=The Royal Horticultural Society |access-date=28 July 2022 |quote=2 suppliers }}</ref>

